        <h2>Content Disclaimer</h2>
        <p>
          The content published on this blog/website is for informational purposes only. The views and opinions expressed in any article, video, 
          or other content are those of the author(s) and do not necessarily reflect the official policy or position of Jamie Ian West.
        </p>
        <p>
          The information provided is not intended to be a substitute for professional advice. Readers should not rely solely on the information 
          contained in this blog/website but should seek appropriate professional advice based on their particular circumstances.
        </p>
        <p>
          We do not guarantee the accuracy, completeness, or usefulness of any information on this site and will not be responsible for any errors, 
          omissions, or delays in this information or any losses, injuries, or damages arising from its display or use.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>External Links Disclaimer</h2>
        <p>
          This Site may contain links to external websites that are not provided or maintained by or in any way affiliated with Jamie Ian West.
        </p>
        <p>
          Please note that we do not guarantee the accuracy, relevance, timeliness, or completeness of any information on these external websites. 
          We have no control over the nature, content, and availability of those sites.
        </p>
        <p>
          The inclusion of any links does not necessarily imply a recommendation or endorsement of the views expressed within them.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Changes to This Disclaimer</h2>
        <p>
          We reserve the right to modify this disclaimer at any time without prior notice. Your continued use of this Site following any changes 
          constitutes acceptance of those changes.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions about this Disclaimer, please contact us:
        </p>
          By email: <a href="mailto:hello@jamieianwest.com">hello@jamieianwest.com</a>
      </section>

      <div class="disclaimer-attribution">
        <p>This document was generated using <a href="https://www.thelawgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">TheLawGPT</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .disclaimer-container {
    width: 100%;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 2rem 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .last-updated {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #666;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  p {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    text-align: justify;
    text-justify: inter-word;
  }

  ul {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }

  .disclaimer-attribution {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #eee;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #777;
  }

  .disclaimer-attribution p {
    text-align: left; /* Keep the attribution left-aligned if preferred */
  }
</style>